{"3702370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Game About Mining an Asteroid", "steam_appid": 3702370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game About Mining an Asteroid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist roguelike take on space mining, space taxes, and space metaprogression. Dig, sell, upgrade, and collect as much as you can until the intergalactic taxes catch up with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.webm?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.mp4?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine For Profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through asteroid interiors, uncover valuable resources, and decide how deep you are willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/fb9c4f0b2f57263cb5621673389bc0bf.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/fb9c4f0b2f57263cb5621673389bc0bf.webm?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/fb9c4f0b2f57263cb5621673389bc0bf.mp4?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/600d0b90d78f84ed590f4145778ec272.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/600d0b90d78f84ed590f4145778ec272.webm?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/600d0b90d78f84ed590f4145778ec272.mp4?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell ore for credits, then spend your hard earned money on upgrading your mining equipment and buying temporary perks and utilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/7cbc0b05a045e24eed8bb37c652bface.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/7cbc0b05a045e24eed8bb37c652bface.webm?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/7cbc0b05a045e24eed8bb37c652bface.mp4?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember to pay your taxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more expensive extraction becomes. Push deeper for better rewards or evacuate before your profits disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/c2152cee9b779fb3ceb822dd2bad9fe8.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=300 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/c2152cee9b779fb3ceb822dd2bad9fe8.webm?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/c2152cee9b779fb3ceb822dd2bad9fe8.mp4?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract ancient alien technology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special types of resources are used to buy persistent perks and unlock access to more types of asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ef3f7f4a86abf1255dbe7dfea7e65a8b.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ef3f7f4a86abf1255dbe7dfea7e65a8b.webm?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ef3f7f4a86abf1255dbe7dfea7e65a8b.mp4?t=1786541486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Excavator LS-564XNFE, may the credits you earn serve as a reminder of your worth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game About Mining an Asteroid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist roguelike take on space mining, space taxes, and space metaprogression. Dig, sell, upgrade, and collect as much as you can until the intergalactic taxes catch up with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.poster.avif?t=1786541486\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/370237